    "report": "projects/ai-eval--frontier-harness-eval.md",
    "depth": "source-reviewed",
    "topics": [
      "evolution",
      "agents",
      "models",
      "decisions"
    ],
    "summary": "Adopt its frozen-manifest, retained-evidence, and comparability-gate patterns for the evaluation service. Treat its public suite as one external benchmark slice, complemented by private team tasks and safety regressions. Do not select a default agent solely from the published rankings. Before running the workflow, review its external runtime requirements and network permissions; this analysis did not execute the benchmark or reproduce its performance claims."
  },
  {
